    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a laptop located on the left side, with a keyboard positioned directly above it. A drill is placed on the right side of the image. For every watch present in the scene, there is a cutting board that is larger than the watch and is located above the drill. Additionally, the laptop is visually larger than this cutting board.",
